  "detailed_description": "The scheme &amp;quot;Assistance to Farmers in Purchasing Nano Fertilizers Under the Agricultural Assistance Program for Farmers Other than Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to provide financial aid to non-SC/ST farmers in Gujarat to help them purchase Nano Fertilizers. By encouraging the use of efficient and innovative agricultural inputs, the scheme strives to boost farm productivity, improve crop yields, and raise the overall economic well-being of farmers.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n  - The applicant must be a farmer.\n  - The applicant must belong to the General category (i.e., not SC or ST).\n  - The applicant must be a resident of Gujarat.\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
